## Flowchart

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[Initialize root = NULL]
    B --> C[/Enter Number of Nodes/]
    C --> D{Is n greater than 0?}

    D -->|No| E[/Display Invalid Number of Nodes/]
    E --> Z([STOP])

    D -->|Yes| F[/Enter Node Values/]
    F --> G[Insert Values into BST]
    G --> H[/Display Original Tree using Inorder Traversal/]
    H --> I[Swap Left and Right Children Recursively]
    I --> J[/Display Mirror Image using Inorder Traversal/]
    J --> K[Delete Tree and Free Memory]
    K --> Z
```
